      "walkthrough": [
        "$\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\mathbf{v}=8q+2(q-1)+6(q^2-7)=6q^2+10q-44$.",
        "$6q^2+10q-44=0$ reduces to $3q^2+5q-22=(q-2)(3q+11)=0$. Thus $q=2$ or $q=-\\frac{11}{3}$."
